<title>USA: TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL SPRINGS, Florida 1997-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$245,000 America's Red Clay Tennis Championship on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat 2-Petr Korda (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>1-6 6-4 retired</p>
<p>4-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-0 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>Johan Van Herck (Belgium) beat 7-Sandon Stolle (Australia)</p>
<p>6-3 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>David Witt (U.S.) beat Frederic Fontang (France) 4-6 2-3</p>
<p>retired</p>
</text>
